# @playform/build output directories. Each Element package writes compiled
# .js files to `Element/<Name>/Configuration/`, mirroring the `Source/`
# tree. Built artefacts - not source - must not be reformatted. The patterns
# deliberately omit `Source/Configuration/` (those are real source files).
# Both forms are required: trailing `/` covers directory-level skipping;
# `/**` covers individual file-path checks in the ignore package.
Element/*/Configuration/
Element/*/Configuration/**

